flowchart TD
  U[Browser] --> CF[CloudFront + WAF]
  CF --> FE[Next.js on ECS Fargate]
  CF --> GW[API Gateway]
  U -. sign-in .-> COG[Cognito]
  GW -- verifies JWT --> COG
  GW --> API[FastAPI on ECS Fargate]
  API --> DB[(RDS PostgreSQL)]
  API --> Q[SQS run queue]
  Q --> W[Agent worker on ECS]
  Q -. after retries .-> DLQ[Dead-letter queue]
  W --> DB
  W -- first --> BG[Bedrock Guardrails]
  BG -- request and reply checked --> BR[Amazon Bedrock]
  W -. if Bedrock fails .-> LG[LangGraph + LangChain]
  LG --> MW[Guardrail middleware]
  MW -- request and reply checked --> GQ[Groq]
  W --> CON[Action connectors]
  API --> CW[CloudWatch + X-Ray]
  W --> CW
  DB -. audit export .-> S3[S3 Object Lock]
  SM[Secrets Manager] --> API
  SM --> W
